WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:02.920
Two, three, four!
Oh, wait.

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:05.464
We almost forgot about
our special guest.

00:00:05.464 --> 00:00:07.925
Helpsters!
- K.Flay!

00:00:07.925 --> 00:00:11.803
Helpsters, we start looping
our sounds when K.Flay tells us

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:13.889
and then stop
when she stops singing.

00:00:13.889 --> 00:00:15.766
Sound good?
- Sounds great!

00:00:15.766 --> 00:00:16.808
Go for it, Heart.

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:19.311
[HEART VOCALIZES]

00:00:19.311 --> 00:00:21.355
Your turn, Mister Primm.

00:00:21.355 --> 00:00:24.691
[MISTER PRIMM VOCALIZES]

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:26.068
Now you, Cody.

00:00:26.068 --> 00:00:29.321
[CODY VOCALIZES]

00:00:29.321 --> 00:00:30.781
Scatter.

00:00:30.781 --> 00:00:32.783
[SCATTER VOCALIZES]

00:00:32.783 --> 00:00:34.576
[ALL VOCALIZING]

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:37.079
♪ I like pencils. ♪

00:00:37.079 --> 00:00:39.081
♪ And that's because
I like to draw. ♪

00:00:39.081 --> 00:00:41.541
♪ I like pencils. ♪

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:43.961
♪ And I can draw
anything at all. ♪

00:00:43.961 --> 00:00:46.213
♪ I can draw a spoon,
I can draw a tree, ♪

00:00:46.213 --> 00:00:48.340
♪ I can draw anything
that’s in front of me. ♪

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:50.926
♪ I can draw my pencil
if I choose, ♪

00:00:50.926 --> 00:00:55.013
♪ and then I get to use
another pencil. ♪

00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:57.391
♪ 'Cause I like pencils. ♪

00:00:57.391 --> 00:00:58.642
♪ I like pencils. ♪

00:00:58.642 --> 00:01:00.435
[VOCALIZING STOPS]
Oh, thank you so much

00:01:00.435 --> 00:01:02.187
for making music with us,
K.Flay!

00:01:02.187 --> 00:01:03.230
Thank you, Helpters.

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:04.773
You're very welcome.

00:01:04.773 --> 00:01:06.817
♪ Helpsters! ♪

00:01:06.817 --> 00:01:12.114
♪

